          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.618,
            0.711,
            0.639
          ],
          "content": "11. **Individual Project:** Pick at least one of the following:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.188,
            0.643,
            0.847,
            0.683
          ],
          "content": "(a) How Long is a Sentence? Pick any two textbooks from different subjects. Choose any page with a lot of text from each book."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.228,
            0.687,
            0.847,
            0.727
          ],
          "content": "(i) Use a dot plot to describe how many words the sentences have on each page."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.228,
            0.731,
            0.846,
            0.752
          ],
          "content": "(ii) Compare the data of both the pages using mean and median."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.188,
            0.756,
            0.847,
            0.814
          ],
          "content": "(b) What is in a Name? Write down the names of all of your classmates. The following are some interesting things you can do with this data!"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.228,
            0.819,
            0.847,
            0.858
          ],
          "content": "(i) Find the mean and median name length (number of letters in a name)."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.229,
            0.863,
            0.847,
            0.902
          ],
          "content": "(ii) Visualise the data and describe its variability and central tendency."
